2}+n\\pi,n\\pi).$” is false. The function is positive on $(0,\\frac{\\pi}{2})$ and negative on $(-\\frac{\\pi}{2},0).$ The period is $\\pi,$ so these signs repeat after each integer multiple of $\\pi.$\n\n- Statement “The least positive period is $\\pi.$” is true. The graph repeats after a horizontal shift of $\\pi,$ and no smaller positive shift repeats the whole graph. Therefore, the least positive period is $\\pi.$\n\nSo, the correct answer is “The domain is all real numbers except $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi.$”; “The least positive period is $\\pi.$” only."} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1fc6d116-71fd-5ee8-872a-349a07304b3d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515922} {:answer/id #uuid "b009f358-bfd7-5f04-b8e5-d66ffdcfbaef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515974}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186515922} :answer-field/id #uuid "fde6c007-7dfd-585a-9a96-dd7bf33c447e" :answer-field/key "The function is positive throughout $(n\\pi,\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi).$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516012} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186516013 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "73b37b97-b986-5456-8e62-34787bd79605" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515946} {:answer/id #uuid "b325d968-3efb-56f5-acbb-1eb81a3be0e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515975}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186515975} :answer-field/id #uuid "cad6637a-6bd9-5a4d-9bd5-7590635e9ec4" :answer-field/key "The domain is all real numbers except $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515985} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e157c8c-8176-5d3f-a03a-8db996797e4e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499